  "message": "I checked with toyota_mechanic: Fixed. The mechanic traced the pause bug to `receptionist_team/adapters/voice_io.py`, where sentence splitting was triggering on any period — including single-letter initials (e.g. \"J. Smith\") — causing spurious pauses. It added a check to skip splitting after single-letter initials.\n\n**Changed:**\n- `receptionist_team/adapters/voice_io.py`\n- `receptionist_team/tests/test_voice_io_abbreviation_split.py` (new tests)\n\nAll 45 tests passed (up from 43 baseline, no regressions). Toyota restarts automatically about 30 seconds after this reply — she may be briefly offline during that — and will roll back on her own if she doesn't come back healthy. No manual restart or browser refresh needed.",
